:toml`, licensed under [the LGPLv3](https://github.com/TheElectronWill/night-config/blob/v3.7.3/LICENSE).\n\n21.1.x-latest\n\n* Add Placer Plus\n\n (2024-11-07T13:26:35.805Z)","21.1.110":"QuarryPlus(v21.1.110) for Minecraft 1.21.1\n---\n\nThe fabric version includes the binaries of `com.electronwill.night-config:core` and `com.electronwill.night-config:toml`, licensed under [the LGPLv3](https://github.com/TheElectronWill/night-config/blob/v3.7.3/LICENSE).\n\n21.1.x-latest\n\n* Change the system of gathering drops in NeoForge to respect BlockDropsEvent\n\n (2024-10-20T08:21:26.148Z)","21.1.109":"QuarryPlus(v21.1.109) for Minecraft 1.21.1\n---\n\nThe fabric version includes the binaries of `com.electronwill.night-config:core` and `com.electronwill.night-config:toml`, licensed under [the LGPLv3](https://github.com/TheElectronWill/night-config/blob/v3.7.3/LICENSE).\n\n21.1.x-latest\n\n* Efficiency now increases the energy capacity of machines\n* Add localization for pickaxe enchantment\n* Fix [#643](https://github.com/Kotori316/QuarryPlus/issues/643) by passing mutable list, but the result will never be\n  used currently\n\n (2024-10-20T06:38:45.747Z)","21.1.108":"QuarryPlus(v21.1.108) for Minecraft 1.21.1\n---\n\nThe fabric version includes the binaries of `com.electronwill.night-config:core` and `com.electronwill.night-config:toml`, licensed under [the LGPLv3](https://github.com/TheElectronWill/night-config/blob/v3.7.3/LICENSE).\n\n21.1.x-latest\n\n* Update recipes in Forge\n  * Use common tag system introduced in `1.21.1-52.0.20`, so this mod required forge newer or equal to `52.0.20`\n* Add Void Module, which can filter items obtained by mining machines\n* Add a config option to convert Deepslate ores to normal one\n* Add a config option to remove common materials obtained by Chunk Destroyer\n  * Default: `true`\n\n (2024-10-14T06:24:12.928Z)","21.1.107":"QuarryPlus(v21.1.107) for Minecraft 1.21.1\n---\n\nThe fabric version includes the binaries of `com.electronwill.night-config:core` and `com.electronwill.night-config:toml`, licensed under [the LGPLv3](https://github.com/TheElectronWill/night-config/blob/v3.7.3/LICENSE).\n\n21.1.x-latest\n\n* Fix a bug where quarry accepts more energy than its capacity at once\n\n (2024-10-12T02:18:39.194Z)","21.1.106":"QuarryPlus(v21.1.106) for Minecraft 1.21.1\n---\n\nThe fabric version includes the binaries of `com.electronwill.night-config:core` and `com.electronwill.night-config:toml`, licensed under [the LGPLv3](https://github.com/TheElectronWill/night-config/blob/v3.7.3/LICENSE).\n\n21.1.x-latest\n\n* Add ChunkLoader for QuarryPlus and Chunk Destroyer\n\n (2024-10-12T00:44:50.208Z)","21.1.105":"QuarryPlus(v21.1.105) for Minecraft 1.21.1\n---\n\nThe fabric version includes the binaries of `com.electronwill.night-config:core` and `com.electronwill.night-config:toml`, licensed under [the LGPLv3](https://github.com/TheElectronWill/night-config/blob/v3.7.3/LICENSE).\n\n21.1.x-latest\n\n* Chunk Destroyer, experimental\n\n (2024-10-01T14:52:46.594Z)","21.1.104":"QuarryPlus(v21.1.104) for Minecraft 1.21.1\n---\n\nThe fabric version includes the binaries of `com.electronwill.night-config:core` and `com.electronwill.night-config:toml`, licensed under [the LGPLv3](https://github.com/TheElectronWill/night-config/blob/v3.7.3/LICENSE).\n\n21.1.x-latest\n\n* Use Obsidian tags for fabric recipe. This requires fabric newer than or equal to `0.105.0+1.21.1`\n* Add tooltip for generator to ensure the block is for creative\n\n (2024-09-28T10:29:21.453Z)","21.1.103":"QuarryPlus(v21.1.103) for Minecraft 1.21.1\n---\n\nThe fabric version includes the binaries of `com.electronwill.night-config:core` and `com.electronwill.night-config:toml`, licensed under [the LGPLv3](https://github.com/TheElectronWill/night-config/blob/v3.7.3/LICENSE).\n\n21.1.x-latest\n\n* Add a storage for debug usage\n* Add marker log for Status Checker\n\n (2024-09-12T05:47:46.015Z)","21.1.102":"QuarryPlus(v21.1.102) for Minecraft 1.21.1\n---\n\nThe fabric version includes the binaries of `com.electronwill.night-config:core` and `com.electronwill.night-config:toml`, licensed under [the LGPLv3](https://github.com/TheElectronWill/night-config/blob/v3.7.3/LICENSE).\n\n21.1.x-latest\n\n* Implement `No Energy` mode\n\n (2024-08-30T00:15:30.665Z)","21.1.101":"QuarryPlus(v21.1.101) for Minecraft 1.21.1\n---\n\nThe fabric version includes the binaries of `com.electronwill.night-config:core` and `com.electronwill.night-config:toml`, licensed under [the LGPLv3](https://github.com/TheElectronWill/night-config/blob/v3.7.3/LICENSE).\n\n21.1.x-latest\n\n* Add Repeat tick module for Forge and NeoForge\n* Add a config option to remove the top bedrock in the Nether\n\n (2024-08-29T15:23:52.602Z)","21.1.100":"QuarryPlus(v21.1.100) for Minecraft 1.21.1\n---\n\nThe fabric version includes the binaries of `com.electronwill.night-config:core` and `com.electronwill.night-config:toml`, licensed under [the LGPLv3](https://github.com/TheElectronWill/night-config/blob/v3.7.3/LICENSE).\n\n21.1.x-latest\n\n* Add Chunk Marker\n* Add Flexible Marker\n* Add recipe for Exp Module\n* Fix a but where GUIs didn't show transparent worlds as background\n\n (2024-08-28T15:34:59.327Z)","21.1.99":"QuarryPlus(v21.1.99) for Minecraft 1.21.1\n---\n\nThe fabric version includes the binaries of `com.electronwill.night-config:core` and `com.electronwill.night-config:toml`, licensed under [the LGPLv3](https://github.com/TheElectronWill/night-config/blob/v3.7.3/LICENSE).\n\n21.1.x-latest\n\n* Register Packets in Fabric\n\n (2024-08-24T00:51:14.934Z)","21.1.98":"QuarryPlus(v21.1.98) for Minecraft 1.21.1\n---\n\nThe fabric version includes the binaries of `com.electronwill.night-config:core` and `com.electronwill.night-config:toml`, licensed under [the LGPLv3](https://github.com/TheElectronWill/night-config/blob/v3.7.3/LICENSE).\n\n21.1.x-latest\n\n* Register Packets in Fabric\n\n (2024-08-24T00:06:16.928Z)","21.1.97":"QuarryPlus(v21.1.97) for Minecraft 1.21.1\n---\n21.1.x-latest\n\n* Optimize internal code\n* Mark Stable for some mod packs\n  * This doesn't mean there are not bugs\n\n (2024-08-23T15:05:51.406Z)","21.1.95":"QuarryPlus(v21.1.95) for Minecraft 1.21.1\n---\n21.1.x-latest\n\n* Module system\n  * Add modules to quarry to enhance quarry work\n  * Pump Module enables quarry to remove fluids\n  * Bedrock Remove Module enables quarry to remove Bedrock at the bottom of the world\n  * Not available in Fabric\n    * Just open GUI to toggle pump\n    * Use Bedrock Module to remove Bedrock\n\n (2024-08-17T06:01:20.226Z)","21.1.94":"QuarryPlus(v21.1.94) for Minecraft 1.21.1\n---\n21.1.x-latest\n\n* Fix a bug of quarry's save data(enchantments)\n\n (2024-08-16T12:47:07.200Z)","21.1.93":"QuarryPlus(v21.1.93) for Minecraft 1.21.1\n---\n21.1.x-latest\n\n* Fix a bug of quarry's save data(digMinY)\n\n (2024-08-15T12:20:32.544Z)","21.1.92":"QuarryPlus(v21.1.92) for Minecraft 1.21.1\n---\n21.1.x-latest\n\n* Fix a bug of quarry's save data(digMinY)\n\n (2024-08-15T01:44:40.836Z)","21.1.91":"QuarryPlus(v21.1.91) for Minecraft 1.21.1\n---\n21.1.x-latest\n\n* Support Quarry enchantment\n\n (2024-08-14T13:49:29.926Z)","21.1.89":"QuarryPlus(v21.1.89) for Minecraft 1.21.1\n---\n21.1.x\n\n* Update for Minecraft 1.21.1\n\n (2024-08-09T04:20:25.364Z)"}}
